  "description": "Reincarnated as a mixed-race high school girl, Lee Ah-rin finds herself in a complicated situation. After suffering from bullying trauma, she tries to avoid getting close to others. However, she becomes entangled with the charming and beloved Rose Hwan, who has a rebellious side. As she interacts more with them, memories of her past life begin to resurface. This story unfolds a love triangle between the Little Prince, a fox, and a rose in a school setting!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=833623), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11769386)",
